the feelings I have for Leo and Kazuma.

848
00:51:14,946 --> 00:51:16,531
I'm really glad I met you.

849
00:51:17,324 --> 00:51:20,994
I was able to grow as a person too,
because I got to know you.

850
00:51:22,621 --> 00:51:23,455
Mmm.

851
00:51:23,955 --> 00:51:26,416
- So thank you for coming into my life.
- Thank you.

852
00:51:42,641 --> 00:51:43,475
Leo.

853
00:51:47,521 --> 00:51:48,772
With you…

854
00:51:49,981 --> 00:51:51,233
since we came here,

855
00:51:52,234 --> 00:51:54,945
