than anyone else.

856
00:51:56,279 --> 00:51:59,074
<i>You were always honest
about feelings for me.</i>

857
00:51:59,699 --> 00:52:02,661
<i>Every single word you said
resonated with me.</i>

858
00:52:04,204 --> 00:52:06,373
<i>More than anything anyone else said.</i>

859
00:52:08,291 --> 00:52:09,876
Thank you for not wavering

860
00:52:10,544 --> 00:52:14,339
