until the very end.

861
00:52:15,799 --> 00:52:16,633
Thank you.

862
00:52:22,097 --> 00:52:24,933
But the fact is,
when it comes to real life,

863
00:52:25,934 --> 00:52:27,227
there are obstacles…

864
00:52:28,770 --> 00:52:32,274
