867
00:52:40,407 --> 00:52:41,575
the truth is,

868
00:52:42,325 --> 00:52:45,495
I think I'd end up hurting you, eventually.

869
00:52:49,916 --> 00:52:50,834
So…

870
00:52:52,460 --> 00:52:53,503
I'm sorry.

871
00:52:55,839 --> 00:52:56,673
Thank you.

872
