Well, Kazuma, with you,
you were a transfer student,

878
00:53:21,406 --> 00:53:23,575
so compared to Tai-chan and Leo,

879
00:53:24,451 --> 00:53:26,453
we didn't talk as much

880
00:53:27,370 --> 00:53:29,289
or spend as much time together.

881
00:53:30,040 --> 00:53:32,416
So at first, I…

882
00:53:32,417 --> 00:53:35,212
I wasn't really thinking
about you as an option.

883
00:53:38,089 --> 00:53:39,173
But then, you told me

884
00:53:39,174 --> 00:53:42,343
<i>you'd made Valentine's chocolates
for the first time</i>

885
00:53:42,344 --> 00:53:43,428
<i>and gave them to me.</i>

886
00:53:44,054 --> 00:53:48,600
<i>And then we…
went on that overnight villa trip.</i>

887
00:53:49,476 --> 00:53:51,269
We talked about a lot of things.

888
00:53:53,521 --> 00:53:55,565
It was really intense.

889
00:53:58,068 --> 00:53:59,611
And the walls I'd put up…

890
00:54:01,947 --> 00:54:03,531
