895
00:54:25,220 --> 00:54:28,682
So even when you spoke honestly
and shared your feelings with me,

896
00:54:29,349 --> 00:54:31,851
there was still a part of me

897
00:54:32,936 --> 00:54:35,188
that couldn't trust them 100%.

898
00:54:37,440 --> 00:54:39,234
- <i>Uh?</i>
- <i>Hmm?</i>

899
00:54:44,239 --> 00:54:45,407
But time passed,

900
00:54:46,241 --> 00:54:48,034
and something changed inside,

901
00:54:50,662 --> 00:54:55,500
and like, after we did the fireworks,
I found myself thinking,

902
00:54:56,918 --> 00:54:58,086
"I really wish…

903
00:54:58,753 --> 00:54:59,754
I was with Kazuma."

904
00:55:04,676 --> 00:55:05,844
Let's go back together.

905
00:55:08,972 --> 00:55:11,432
<i>Man!</i>

906
00:55:11,433 --> 00:55:14,394
<i>Congratulations!</i>

907
00:55:16,146 --> 00:55:18,189
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

908
00:55:19,357 --> 00:55:20,442
Wait here a sec.

909
00:55:22,944 --> 00:55:23,820
- Thank you.
- Thanks.

910
00:55:24,571 --> 00:55:25,696
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

911
00:55:25,697 --> 00:55:27,323
<i>Aw, Leo's a good man.</i>

912
00:55:27,324 --> 00:55:28,615
This way.

913
00:55:28,616 --> 00:55:30,659
- <i>The guys' friendship.</i>
- <i>Tai-chan too.</i>

914
00:55:30,660 --> 00:55:33,412
<i>Seriously, Leo, you were really cool.</i>

915
00:55:33,413 --> 00:55:35,539
- I wish you the best.
- Thank you.

916
00:55:35,540 --> 00:55:37,417
<i>Super cool. Wonderful.</i>

917
00:55:40,628 --> 00:55:43,298
<i>- It's heartbreaking.</i>
- <i>It really is.</i>

918
00:55:44,382 --> 00:55:46,217
<i>You don't just move on from that.</i>

919
00:55:47,677 --> 00:55:49,428
- All right.
- Leo.

920
00:55:49,429 --> 00:55:50,346
Let's go.

921
00:55:50,347 --> 00:55:51,305
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

922
00:55:51,306 --> 00:55:53,224
- <i>So that's it?</i>
- <i>Is it?</i>

923
00:55:54,142 --> 00:55:55,435
<i>So it's over.</i>

924
00:55:56,853 --> 00:55:57,937
<i>It's over!</i>

925
00:56:00,482 --> 00:56:01,900
<i>That was fun!</i>

926
00:56:02,817 --> 00:56:04,736
Badly In Love Season 2 was great!

927
00:56:05,528 --> 00:56:07,446
- <i>I'm getting emotional.</i>
