949
00:57:14,848 --> 00:57:16,266
We went down with dignity.

950
00:57:16,933 --> 00:57:18,016
- Yeah, we did.
- Right?

951
00:57:18,017 --> 00:57:20,436
At least for us,
we made a lot of good memories.

952
00:57:20,437 --> 00:57:22,187
- I did. No regrets.
- It was fun.

953
00:57:22,188 --> 00:57:24,314
- No regrets?
- I gave it my all. No regrets.

954
00:57:24,315 --> 00:57:25,859
- That's good.
- Yeah.

955
00:57:26,401 --> 00:57:28,444
- Thank you so much.
- Thanks, guys.

956
00:57:28,445 --> 00:57:29,778
- See ya.
- Thank you.

957
00:57:29,779 --> 00:57:32,364
- Thank you.
- See you again.

958
