your all with no regrets?</i>

985
00:58:49,400 --> 00:58:55,531
<i>Tai-chan, despite many struggles
and many tears, you showed us growth.</i>

986
00:58:55,532 --> 00:58:56,366
Mmm.

987
00:58:58,076 --> 00:59:03,038
<i>However, until the very end,
you struggled with who to confess to,</i>

988
00:59:03,039 --> 00:59:06,084
<i>- and were uncertain about finding romance.</i>
- Mmm.

989
00:59:07,293 --> 00:59:10,379
<i>Would you like to go through
this school again,</i>

990
00:59:10,380 --> 00:59:13,006
<i>- find the woman you love…</i>
- <i>Wait, what?</i>

991
00:59:13,007 --> 00:59:15,468
<i>- …and have another chance?</i>
- <i>Wait, what is this?</i>

992
00:59:16,302 --> 00:59:19,806
<i>We're saying,
if you're willing to try again, Tai-chan…</i>

993
00:59:21,349 --> 00:59:23,560
<i>then please repeat the year.</i>

994
00:59:27,146 --> 00:59:27,981
Okay.

995
00:59:30,233 --> 00:59:31,067
Yeah.

996
00:59:36,155 --> 00:59:37,991
- <i>What?</i>
- <i>What does this even mean?</i>

997
00:59:42,328 --> 00:59:44,288
What? It's someone new.

998
00:59:44,289 --> 00:59:45,581
What?

999
00:59:45,582 --> 00:59:50,587
MARINE ACADEMY LOVE

1000
00:59:51,504 --> 00:59:57,009
BRING ON THE FIGHT
BRING ON LOVE

1001
00:59:57,010 --> 01:00:03,515
UNTIL LOVE BLOOMS,
THE LADIES WALK THROUGH HELL

1002
01:00:03,516 --> 01:00:10,356
TO FIND TRUE LOVE,
THE MEN GO TO HELL AND BACK

1003
01:00:18,948 --> 01:00:20,283
HANDLE WITH CARE

1004
01:00:22,827 --> 01:00:23,745
<i>Huh?</i>

1005
01:00:24,996 --> 01:00:26,788
<i>Wait. Who is that?</i>

1006
01:00:26,789 --> 01:00:27,832
<i>Unknown tattoo.</i>

1007
01:00:42,138 --> 01:00:43,014
What the hell?

1008
01:00:44,015 --> 01:00:45,182
What's all this crap?

1009
01:00:45,183 --> 01:00:46,975
Come on, you bastard!

1010
01:00:46,976 --> 01:00:49,145
- Who are you?
- Bring it on, dumbass!

1011
01:00:53,316 --> 01:00:55,359
BADLY IN LOVE 2
CLASS 2 NOW BEGINS

1012
01:00:55,360 --> 01:00:57,362
- <i>So, there you have it.</i>
- <i>What?</i>

1013
01:00:58,029 --> 01:01:00,197
Second term of <i>Badly In Love</i> Season 2,

1014
01:01:00,198 --> 01:01:01,406
- Part 2 begins!
- Whoa!

1015
01:01:01,407 --> 01:01:03,659
- Thank you very much.
- What?

1016
01:01:03,660 --> 01:01:04,661
What does this mean?

1017
01:01:05,411 --> 01:01:09,457
Um, right, for Part 2,
we have eight new men and women

1018
01:01:10,041 --> 01:01:11,668
gathered in Okinawa.

1019
01:01:12,335 --> 01:01:14,336
- What the heck?
- A new 14-day love story

1020
01:01:14,337 --> 01:01:16,463
- is about to begin.
- What?

1021
01:01:16,464 --> 01:01:18,674
So it's not Season 3, it's Part 2.

1022
01:01:18,675 --> 01:01:19,966
We'll just keep rolling.

1023
01:01:19,967 --> 01:01:21,551
Wait, I'm staying too?

1024
01:01:21,552 --> 01:01:22,844
Of course. Yes.

1025
01:01:22,845 --> 01:01:24,971
Hey, we can't have you leaving, Sensei.

1026
01:01:24,972 --> 01:01:28,225
We're starting again
with the same amount of energy.

1027
01:01:28,226 --> 01:01:30,728
Just end it already.
